    "Auralis 不宣称 bit-perfect。无法从当前链路读取的参数明确显示为“未知”。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auralis does not claim bit-perfect. Unreadable parameters are shown as Unknown."
          }
