    "凭据只保存在系统 Keychain，不会写入日志、不会发送给大模型。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Credentials are stored only in the system Keychain; never logged or sent to the model."
